&lt;p&gt;The feature matrix lists environments under the Enterprise plan. Layer5 Cloud does not refuse environment actions because of the plan.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Workspaces</title><link>/pr-preview/pr-1339/cloud/guides/workspaces/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/pr-preview/pr-1339/cloud/guides/workspaces/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Workspaces and environments are how an organization decides which teams can reach which connections and where its designs live. These guides cover the tasks. For the model, read the &lt;a href="/pr-preview/pr-1339/cloud/concepts/workspaces/"&gt;Workspaces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="/pr-preview/pr-1339/cloud/concepts/environments/"&gt;Environments&lt;/a&gt; concepts. For limits, defaults, and error messages in one place, see the &lt;a href="/pr-preview/pr-1339/cloud/reference/workspaces-and-environments/"&gt;Workspace and Environment Reference&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
 &lt;thead&gt;
